{"vid":"2gCk9yBBOUo","source":"2gCk9yBBOUo.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"What is a turnaround?"},{"t":4,"txt":"Well, whether you call them shutdowns,"},{"t":6.6,"txt":"outages, or turnarounds, they'll all"},{"t":8.8,"txt":"produce the same results. Turnarounds"},{"t":11.3,"txt":"are scheduled events where an entire"},{"t":13.2,"txt":"process unit of an industrial plant is"},{"t":15.8,"txt":"taken off-stream for a scheduled period"},{"t":17.8,"txt":"of time to perform maintenance,"},{"t":19.6,"txt":"inspections, and testing. Once the plant"},{"t":22.4,"txt":"is off-stream, the downtime presents an"},{"t":24.6,"txt":"opportunity that can be used to perform"},{"t":27.6,"txt":"debottlenecking, capital project"},{"t":29.7,"txt":"improvements, revamps, and catalyst"},{"t":32.2,"txt":"regeneration projects. Turnarounds allow"},{"t":34.9,"txt":"for necessary maintenance and the upkeep"},{"t":37,"txt":"of operating units. Turnarounds are"},{"t":39.2,"txt":"needed to maintain safe and efficient"},{"t":41.2,"txt":"operations. If you think of an oil"},{"t":43.6,"txt":"refinery the way you think of your car,"},{"t":46,"txt":"you'll realize there are many types of"},{"t":47.8,"txt":"routine maintenance you need to perform"},{"t":49.4,"txt":"on your car to keep it running"},{"t":50.7,"txt":"efficiently. You should get your oil"},{"t":52.8,"txt":"changed every 3,000 mi. You should get"},{"t":55.4,"txt":"new tires every 50,000 mi or so,"},{"t":58,"txt":"depending on the brand. Then there's"},{"t":59.9,"txt":"your power steering fluid, your"},{"t":61.6,"txt":"transmission, air filters, gaskets, and"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"that's just routine maintenance. What if"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"something malfunctions? Let's say you"},{"t":68.3,"txt":"drive your car for work every day, and"},{"t":70.4,"txt":"that's how you make your living. When"},{"t":72,"txt":"the time comes to make these repairs and"},{"t":74,"txt":"maintenance services, not only will you"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"be spending money, but you'll be losing"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"money since you're not able to use your"},{"t":80.3,"txt":"car for work. Wouldn't this make you"},{"t":82.3,"txt":"want to carefully plan what repairs you"},{"t":84.5,"txt":"would make so that you could spend only"},{"t":86.5,"txt":"what you needed to spend and lose as"},{"t":88.5,"txt":"little money as possible during that"},{"t":90.4,"txt":"downtime?"},{"t":92.1,"txt":"Now, imagine that your car is making you"},{"t":94.1,"txt":"millions of dollars every day. Well,"},{"t":97,"txt":"maybe that's a bit of a stretch for one"},{"t":98.7,"txt":"car, but it isn't a stretch when it"},{"t":100.6,"txt":"comes to a refinery. When a refinery"},{"t":103,"txt":"shuts down for repairs, maintenance, and"},{"t":105.1,"txt":"compliance with regulations, there is no"},{"t":107.4,"txt":"production, and that means the refinery"},{"t":109.6,"txt":"is losing money at that time. What"},{"t":112,"txt":"happens to the materials that are"},{"t":113.4,"txt":"regularly delivered to the refinery?"},{"t":115.9,"txt":"What happens to the other facilities"},{"t":117.7,"txt":"that depend on the oil products that"},{"t":119.4,"txt":"usually come from the refinery?"},{"t":121.7,"txt":"How many workers are needed to perform"},{"t":123.4,"txt":"the maintenance and repairs? Are there"},{"t":125.5,"txt":"enough qualified workers available to"},{"t":128,"txt":"carry out all the needed repairs?"},{"t":130,"txt":"Turnarounds are very expensive both in"},{"t":132.4,"txt":"terms of production that is lost while"},{"t":134.2,"txt":"the process unit is offline and also in"},{"t":136.5,"txt":"terms of direct cost for the labor,"},{"t":139,"txt":"tools, heavy equipment, and materials"},{"t":141.6,"txt":"used to execute the turnaround."},{"t":143.8,"txt":"Turnarounds are the most significant"},{"t":145.4,"txt":"portion of a plant's yearly maintenance"},{"t":147.1,"txt":"budget and can affect the company's"},{"t":148.9,"txt":"bottom line if they are mismanaged."},{"t":151,"txt":"Turnarounds have unique project"},{"t":152.8,"txt":"management characteristics, which make"},{"t":154.8,"txt":"them volatile and challenging."},{"t":157.9,"txt":"At EPCM PSI, we specialize in project"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"management for turnarounds as well as"},{"t":163.6,"txt":"capital and routine maintenance. We are"},{"t":165.8,"txt":"experts in Primavera, the industry"},{"t":167.7,"txt":"standard software for scheduling. We"},{"t":170.3,"txt":"schedule the work to be done through the"},{"t":171.8,"txt":"use of our trademarked dynamic"},{"t":173.7,"txt":"scheduling methodology called"},{"t":175.6,"txt":"float-based prioritization. Our"},{"t":178,"txt":"methodology has been proven as an"},{"t":179.8,"txt":"effective way to manage turnarounds and"},{"t":182.2,"txt":"any type of outage on time and within"},{"t":184.8,"txt":"budget. We also plan, estimate, and"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"provide cost controls. EPCM PSI's motto"},{"t":191,"txt":"is to provide solutions and valued"},{"t":193.2,"txt":"service as opposed to simply providing"},{"t":195.3,"txt":"resources. EPCM PSI helps your company"},{"t":198.8,"txt":"plan for success."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"What"},{"t":0.44,"w":"is"},{"t":0.84,"w":"a"},{"t":0.92,"w":"turnaround?"},{"t":3.96,"w":"Well,"},{"t":4.8,"w":"whether"},{"t":5.12,"w":"you"},{"t":5.28,"w":"call"},{"t":5.48,"w":"them"},{"t":5.68,"w":"shutdowns,"},{"t":6.56,"w":"outages,"},{"t":7.16,"w":"or"},{"t":7.36,"w":"turnarounds,"},{"t":8.32,"w":"they'll"},{"t":8.56,"w":"all"},{"t":8.76,"w":"produce"},{"t":9.2,"w":"the"},{"t":9.32,"w":"same"},{"t":9.72,"w":"results."},{"t":10.64,"w":"Turnarounds"},{"t":11.32,"w":"are"},{"t":11.48,"w":"scheduled"},{"t":12.04,"w":"events"},{"t":12.48,"w":"where"},{"t":12.56,"w":"an"},{"t":12.68,"w":"entire"},{"t":13.24,"w":"process"},{"t":13.76,"w":"unit"},{"t":14.08,"w":"of"},{"t":14.2,"w":"an"},{"t":14.28,"w":"industrial"},{"t":15,"w":"plant"},{"t":15.6,"w":"is"},{"t":15.8,"w":"taken"},{"t":16.12,"w":"off-stream"},{"t